  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.0.0-Prerelease15/CHANGELOG.md#100-prerelease15\n\nNew features\n- Per-tree looks\n- Look comparison page\n- Button and activity indicator colors per scheme\n- Look skill\n- Android Material 2 and Material 3 looks\n- Core enabled state and tap command\n- MAUI image sources on the Core layer\n- AutomationIds that UI tests find\n- Disabled button fill\n- Per-field chrome on text fields and pickers\n- Interfaces for shared property sets\n- Pressed state on Core nodes\n- Clear buttons are accessibility elements",
